  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Health Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Global Health (GH)):  Ghana. GHWI $300,000 thousand Integrated Health Partnership. Key areas of interventions may include increasing the availability of well-equipped PHC workforce, maximizing employment, and advancing labor standards. The interventions will also guide integration and catalyze achievement of health goals by addressing common health workforce challenges which present as common barriers across programs. Activities will utilize innovative approaches and advance partnership with local stakeholders with focus on the key areas of interventions listed above.</narrative>
  </description>
